      "claim": "Oritavancin, a close analogue sharing the vancomycin glycopeptide scaffold, exhibited only 1–5% CSF penetration in a rabbit meningitis model, directly demonstrating poor CNS access for this structural class.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
