    "No direct vancomycin CSF or brain measurement is present in the retrieved evidence; the closest evidence is oritavancin.",
    "No unbound brain/plasma or CSF pharmacokinetic data are available for the query.",
    "No explicit efflux-transporter data are provided.",
    "Positive small-molecule glycoside evidence is structurally distant and not mechanistically transferable to the query."
  ],
